        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0541" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg532"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2231/282: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Ecuador</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-08T19:00:00-04:00">August 8, 1938—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>49. Your 95 and 97 August 8.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>It is assumed that decree promulgating agreement as amended by notes will
                        be dated 8th or 9th.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Please make every effort to get the Ecuadorans to substitute for the words
                        quoted in your 95 the following in paragraph at end of reply note: <quote
                            rend="blockquote">
                            <p>“It is the understanding of my Government that these changes do not
                                alter the substance of aforementioned concessions.”</p>
                        </quote></item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Ecuadoran wording is not clear and might be construed to qualify
                        acceptance of changes. The wording proposed in 2 above, in separate
                        paragraph at end, is believed to be more accurate and does not qualify
                        acceptance.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Department will await word from you in regard to text of reply note and
                        date of decree before issuing announcement of signature of agreement.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
